WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.820
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:13.570
Let's showtime!

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:16.870
S-So...

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:18.830
What do you think he means?

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:19.950
It smells nice.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:20.750
That would be—

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.830
May I explain?

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.000
If you would.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.130
Of course. Do you all know the brand for which I am the main model, Romance Kiss?

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:34.430
Yes.

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:38.390
We'll be holding a collaborative show with them,

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:43.770
and among the events will be a fashion model contest open only to first-years.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:46.520
When you say first-years...

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.020
You mean just us?

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.780
I'll be watching very closely

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:52.940
to see how your Aikatsu has developed.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:53.780
Okay!

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.320
I'll do my best!

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.530
Yozora-senpai, please watch me!

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.040
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:42.970
Koharu-chan?

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:45.430
Koharu-chan!

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:48.520
Huh? What is it?

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.600
Why were you spacing out?

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.520
Well, no reason...

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:53.980
Oh, no!

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:56.110
Yume, we need to get going!

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:57.990
Oh right, I forgot!

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:00.490
Do you need to be somewhere?

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:03.490
Song Class's got a lesson before our next class.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:06.950
Sorry, Koharu. Come on, let's go.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.410
Bye, Koharu-chan. See you later.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:10.210
Bye.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:16.000
<i>Yume-chan and Rola are really focused.</i>

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:23.140
One, two. One, two.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.980
It seems you need a bit more practice.

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:31.100
There isn't much time until the contest.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.020
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:35.900
Next, Mahiru-san.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:37.400
Okay.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.410
Look at that bottle! {well, whatever}

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.280
Unbelievable...

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:47.540
It's a two-liter bottle!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.380
There, now turn!

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.250
And pose!

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.430
Good, nicely done.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.550
I expected no less.

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:09.310
That will be it for today. Dismissed.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.480
Thank you very much.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:14.770
Here.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:21.400
It's a cough drop.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:27.160
I also have orange and mint ones, as well as a lozenge. {alright, so there are four nodo ame, and one different, the troche. nobody knows what that is, and I thought about saying menthol or sweet menthol, but decided with  this. I know they're the same thing, I don't know what Koharu's saying}

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.410
You sure have a lot.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:34.170
I've always had all sorts of things stuffed in my pockets since I was little.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:37.130
One of my friends even used to say I was like a grab bag. {I haven't considered this before, but it finally actually fits. fuck jack-in-the-box}

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:41.760
I guess I'll take the mint then.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:44.180
Sure thing, Mahiru-chan.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.640
What is it?

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.180
Mahiru-chan?

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:52.270
Do you mind if I call you Koharu, then?

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.770
Not at all!

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:58.020
Thanks. I'll see you later, Koharu.

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:59.150
Bye-bye!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.030
You're amazing, Koharu-chan.

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:03.900
Huh? Why's that?

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:08.450
Mahiru-san just seems so adultlike that it's hard to talk to her.

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:10.030
You think so?

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:14.960
<i>Though it is true that her abilities make us look like children next to her.</i>

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.680
It's heavy!

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:31.220
That much is nothing. The foundation of every idol is her stamina.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:32.930
Her Aikatsu Power, you might say.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.270
Stop making sense...

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:41.270
It suddenly got a lot lighter. 
So this is Aikatsu Power.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.530
I'll lend you a hand.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.070
Koharu-chan! Are you sure?

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.360
We should help each other in times of need.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:49.820
Thanks.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:51.950
Ready to start moving?

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.290
Yeah.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.700
One, two, three!

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:58.460
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:02.880
<i>It's so heavy, yet Yume-chan was carrying it all by herself.</i>

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.590
<i>So the foundation of an idol is her stamina, huh?</i>

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:10.340
I'm exhausted!

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:13.220
My entire body aches.

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:16.600
My knees have been rattling too.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.100
Sorry for making you help out.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:22.690
That's okay. I'm sorry I wasn't able to help much.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:26.150
That's not true, you were a huge help.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.740
It's nice to hear that. {because lines}

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.370
Hey, Yume-chan.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:38.000
There's something I'd like to talk about.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.880
Yume-chan?

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.380
Yume-chan?

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.890
She's fast asleep.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.390
Koharu-chan!

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.770
We'll do it together!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.270
Huh?

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.640
Let's get into S4!

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:05.320
We'll get into S4 together...

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:12.620
That's right. This is no time to feel sorry for myself.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.080
I will become Beauty Class's... {top star, S4}

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.450
Right!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.210
And to make it I must Aikatsu!

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:28.760
Okay, the most important things for fashion models are walking technique and poses. {which is why she tries clothes on...?}{she uses the clothes to practice her posing}

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:35.010
First, I'll go for an elegant style like Yozora-senpai and Mahiru-chan's.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.930
Sometimes the intellectual look is your best bet.

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.020
A cute look might be nice too.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:45.270
It could be fun to make a big splash!

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:50.860
Sometimes going off the rails is right!
The unexpected can feel so refreshing.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:53.240
Or maybe...

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:55.830
What about this?

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:00.290
They all feel off somehow...{hey, stop stealing my word order}

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:02.920
Maybe I need something even more drastic.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.420
Huh?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:09.800
I guess I just passed out. {for this sentence structure something different feels better}

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.820
Y-Yume-chan! It's me, Koharu!

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:40.700
Koharu-chan?

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.830
What's with that getup?

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:50.710
There's going to be a fashion model contest just for the Beauty Class first-years.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:53.220
And are you going to participate?

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:54.930
Um, yeah...

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:56.090
That's great!

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:58.470
I can hardly wait.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.400
So sleepy...

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:09.060
Didn't we promise to wake up for early morning training together?

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.480
Yeah...

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:16.240
Huh? Is Koharu going in for an early lesson too?

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:18.820
I hope it's not for anything bad.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:21.870
You don't want to enter the contest?

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:22.830
Yes.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:28.710
I feel like my skills aren't up to par, 
and I don't have any confidence either.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:33.710
This contest is in large part a test of your courage.

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:36.220
Don't be afraid to let your lack of skills show

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.260
and demonstrate exactly where you stand right now.

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.310
But...

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:43.600
There, that's enough for now.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.810
Your friends have come to see you out.

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:50.610
He noticed us.

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:52.610
Of course he did!

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:58.110
If it was worrying you that much, 
why didn't you tell us about it yesterday?

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:01.490
Sorry, I couldn't find the right time.

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:04.750
Still, why don't you want to enter the contest?

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.000
Because, well...

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.380
You should be more confident.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.880
There's no reason for me to feel confident.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:16.010
That's not true! Do you not remember?

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:20.090
Yume-chan!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.760
That part goes like this!

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:25.770
Awesome, awesome!

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.810
You learn so fast, Koharu-chan!

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.400
Want to watch the others?

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:34.320
I have lots more!

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:38.400
Your pockets are like a grab bag!

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:43.620
You've known so much about idols since we were kids,

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:47.120
and you memorized lyrics and dances way faster than I ever could.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:50.790
I always looked up to you.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:53.460
That was back when we were children.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:55.460
No, it's still true.

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.210
What?

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:57.550
Listen, Koharu-chan.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:02.300
You're modest, perceptive, and kind to everyone.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:06.850
I loved you when we were little, 
and I love you now, Koharu-chan.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.350
Well, you're nothing like Yume here.

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.270
Yep!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.440
Wait, what's that supposed to mean?

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.820
You don't get it?

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.570
I'm saying that being different is a good thing.

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.570
I love you and Rola too!

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:26.200
You have everything that I don't have.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:29.750
The S4 girls' personalities are completely different too.{yuuuuume miru tame umareta // toberu yo ganbaru onna no ko}

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:33.080
But each of them still commands a huge fanbase.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:36.840
She's right. Be more confident in yourself!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:39.260
Yeah, I'll do my best!

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.840
That's what I like to hear!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:44.220
Okay! Now that you're ready to go, we'll help you out too!

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:45.100
Huh?

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:48.020
You said it yourself yesterday.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.730
That we should help each other in times of need.

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:52.520
Thank you!

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:00.570
You can do it.

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:02.360
Almost there.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.240
You were close!

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.160
All right, one more try!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.370
Are you okay?

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:18.380
Yeah. But if I can't even make it this far, 
the contest isn't looking good.

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:21.880
Koharu-chan, can I give it a try?

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.970
Why would you do it?

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.020
It's heavy...

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:33.140
You're not supposed to use that one for training.

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:34.650
What?

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.320
Yume-chan...

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:40.280
What are you even doing?

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.650
You okay?

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:46.160
I guess that one was way too big.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:53.540
I'll try using it.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:56.130
Seriously?

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.170
Yeah.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:00.170
I need to push my limits to get better.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:03.170
You've got me going. That's the spirit!

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.180
Good luck, Koharu-chan.

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.090
Thanks.

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:16.310
I guess it is tougher.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.690
You all right?

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:19.480
I can still keep going.

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.370
Let's take a break.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.080
You've been at it for two whole hours nonstop.

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.960
Just one last try.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:41.710
<i>Step lightly, and don't tense up.</i>

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:44.210
<i>This is where I stand now.</i>

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.470
<i>That's the way.</i>

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:49.220
<i>Keep your breathing steady.</i>

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:53.220
<i>Don't strain, and walk naturally.</i>

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.490
I did it!

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:07.490
I made it to the end!

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:09.240
You're great, Koharu!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.490
You did it!

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.950
Yeah! Thank you!

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:29.510
Thank you for coming tonight to see
Romance Kiss Presents: The Étoile Fashion Show.{so why doesn't the e in etoile have a circumflex over it? does the accent trump the circumflex? do e's just never get circumflexed? because the original word does have an s in it}

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:32.970
Good evening. I'm Kasumi Yozora.

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:41.060
For the first event on tonight's program, 
the first-years of Four Star Academy's Beauty Class

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:43.900
will participate in a fashion model contest.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:48.990
Furthermore, our teachers will assist in the judging

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:52.160
in order to reach an impartial decision on the winner.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.330
I can't contain my excitement! {I did not check previous episodes, still not sure where to go with this}{whatever I guess}

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:00.290
Next is entry number 16,

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.420
Momoi Kokoro-san.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.760
Thank you.

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:18.680
Next is entry number 17, Kasumi Mahiru-san. {oh?}{what of you doing}{my mistake}

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:37.330
That girl's incredible. She's like a real supermodel.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:38.950
She's good.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:51.220
Thank you. Next is our last entrant.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.890
Only one girl it could be!

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:54.340
It's time.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:59.600
Entry number 18, Nanakura Koharu-san.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:39.770
That was fantastic, Koharu-chan!

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:45.270
Seeing her turn that accident right into a pose totally gets me going.

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:47.650
Thank you.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:51.860
And with that, all competitors have completed their entries.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:57.950
The judges' verdict will be announced at the conclusion of the show.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.910
And now for the grand finale.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:05.920
Tonight's main event, Kasumi Yozora-san's performance!

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:26.410
Our judges, including Kasumi Yozora-san, have reached their decision.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:30.040
We will now announce the winner.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:33.580
The fashion show contest Grand Prix goes to...

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:38.550
God, I beg of you. Please help Koharu-chan...

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:41.420
I'm sure she did well enough.

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:46.550
Entry number 17,

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:48.640
Kasumi Mahiru-san!

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:51.850
No way...

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:55.310
I can't deny that her walking was flawless.

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:57.060
And there's one more.

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:02.280
We decided to include a special Judge's Choice award.{I know there are multiple judges but this kind of thing is usually done this way}

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:04.820
The Judge's Choice award goes to... {should this be capitalized?}

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.320
Entry number 18,

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.580
Nanakura Koharu-san.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:18.170
Yay!

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.460
Winners, please step forward.

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:24.130
First, Kasumi Mahiru-san.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:31.350
She embodied the sexy and elegant nature of the Romance Kiss brand

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:34.480
and executed an entrancing walk and assort of poses.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:35.940
You were utterly splendid.

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:37.600
Thank you very much.

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:42.730
And then we have Nanakura Koharu-san.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:47.490
You displayed a brilliant tiny glimmer in your last moments.

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:54.960
In recognition of the potential you showed as a model, we present you with the Judge's Choice award.

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:57.500
Thank you very much!

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:04.760
I'd given up hope, but she really turned it around.{"turned the tables" or "turned it around", not both}{too umineko}

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:08.390
You never know what'll come out of Koharu-chan's grab bag!

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:12.100
<i>Thank you. I couldn't have done this alone.</i>

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:15.640
<i>Let's always work hard for our dreams together.</i>

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:19.310
Let's get into S4 together! {they combined Yume's lines together}

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:23.900
<i>I'm certain we will one day!</i>

00:23:58.040 --> 00:24:00.750
We held a model contest for the first-years.

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:02.830
Kasumi Mahiru-san took first place.

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:05.590
The Judge's Choice award went to Nanakura Koharu-san.

00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:09.340
It was exhilarating witnessing the birth of two future supermodels.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:14.970
Those who strive to be idols can't progress without intelligence and stamina!

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:16.260
And luck too?

00:24:16.260 --> 00:24:18.010
Plus a rival!

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:20.140
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.140 --> 00:24:21.770
Miracle Girls!

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:24.100
Become the first-star idol!
